  "contentHtml": "<p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>학교현장에는 교실에 wifi 가 되지 않는 경우가 많다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'></span></span></p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>모둠별로 태블릿을 주고 수업에 활용하다가, </span><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>인터넷이 되지 않아도 바로&nbsp;통계처리나 정답 처리가 가능한 방법이 없을까? 그래서&nbsp;방법을 생각하다 플리커스 기호가 나오는 앱을 만들게 되었다. 학생들은 앱을 실행시키고 태블릿을 들어 답변해 주면 된다. 최대 63명까지 가능하다.</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 630px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"354\" style=\"height: auto; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/9932ED365E01B2FE27\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile23.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F9932ED365E01B2FE276BC9\" filename=\"20191224_142145.jpg\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>갑자기 인터넷이 끊겨 접속이 되지 않아도, 학생들 태블릿을 플리커스 카드로 바꾸어 바로 답&nbsp;할 수 있다.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>플리커스(Plickers) 기호 카드 앱은 플레이스토어(아래 링크)에서&nbsp;다운 받을 수 있다 </p><p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.plickercard\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=air.com.sciencelove.plickercard</font></u></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 630px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"184\" style=\"height: auto; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/995209405E01B62D29\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile2.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F995209405E01B62D29AE84\" filename=\"사용자 지정 1.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>다 이 앱은 아래 링크에 있는 플리커스(plickers)앱이 있어야 사용할 수 있다.(플리커스가 뭔지 모르는 사람은 아래 링크에 가서 우선 공부를 하자)</span></p><p><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"맑은 고딕\"><a class=\"tx-link\" href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2135\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><u><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">https://sciencelove.com/2135</span></u></strong></a></font></span></p><p><br style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><br style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>플리커스(plickers)를 사용하려면 종이에 인쇄된 카드가 필요하다. </span><span style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'>그래서&nbsp;태블릿 화면이 종이카드 역할을 하도록 만든 것이다. </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Arial\">태블릿을 활용하면&nbsp;종이카드 처럼 나타난 카드를 회전시킬 필요 없다. 자신의 번호 또는 모둠번호를&nbsp;선택하고 답을 선택한 후 그냥 위로 들어주기만 하면 된다.</font><br style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: center; clear: none; float: none;\"><span class=\"imageblock\" style=\"width: 630px; height: auto; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img width=\"630\" height=\"354\" style=\"height: auto; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%;\" src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/tistory/995629335E01B63F30\" srcset=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/R1280x0/?scode=mtistory2&amp;fname=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile9.uf.tistory.com%2Fimage%2F995629335E01B63F303B36\" filename=\"사용자 지정 2.png\" filemime=\"image/jpeg\"></span></p><p><br style='text-align: left; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Roboto, \"Noto Sans KR\", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 300; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;'></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br><br>출처: <a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/2411\"><u><font color=\"#0066cc\">https://sciencelove.com/2411</font></u></a> [김정식 허명성의 과학사랑]<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
